Based on common patterns	Exhaustive search approach
2. Network Layer Security – IPsec
IPsec stands for Internet Protocol Security.

It is a collection of protocols that provides security at the network layer of the OSI/TCP-IP architecture.

It is used to secure IP communication in IPv4 and IPv6 environments.

Security Services of IPsec
