Commonly used in VPNs and gateway-to-gateway communication.
Transport Mode	Tunnel Mode
Protects IP payload	Protects entire original IP packet
Original IP header remains	Original packet is encapsulated
Less overhead	More overhead
Often host-to-host	Often gateway-to-gateway
